  "steps": [
    "Pressure-cook the toor dal with turmeric and 3 cups of water for 4 whistles and mash well.",
    "Heat 1 tsp oil and roast the coriander seeds, chana dal, 2 dried red chillies and fenugreek seeds until aromatic; add the coconut and roast for 1 minute, then grind with water to a smooth paste.",
    "Boil the shallots, drumstick, brinjal, carrot and tomato with the tamarind pulp, salt and 1.5 cups of water until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Add the ground paste and the mashed dal, and simmer for 10 minutes, adding water to adjust consistency.",
    "Heat the remaining oil, crackle the mustard seeds, then add the last dried red chilli, hing and curry leaves.",
    "Pour the tempering over the sambar and serve with rice, idli or dosa."
  ]
